WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.968
[Calm Grounding Piano Intro]

00:00:13.968 --> 00:00:20.000
"He's not angry. He's overwhelmed."

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.500
I see the signs, I know this pain

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:34.000
The static flooding in your brain

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.412
It's not a choice, it's not a flaw

00:00:42.532 --> 00:00:47.274
It's just the world, and all its raw

00:00:47.874 --> 00:00:53.356
Input...

00:00:58.556 --> 00:01:02.500
It's okay. You're safe.

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:05.881
Focus on my voice.

00:01:06.001 --> 00:01:10.500
This isn't a trap, you have a choice.

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:12.465
Just breathe...

00:01:14.886 --> 00:01:17.800
"Aubrey. My name is Aubrie."

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:21.010
"Is it okay if I put my hand on your shoulder?"

00:01:23.752 --> 00:01:27.234
"Is it okay... if I hug you?"

00:01:37.894 --> 00:01:41.876
I'm here. I've got you.

00:01:44.498 --> 00:01:48.000
You're not alone.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:02:06.738
[Warm Swelling Strings and Piano Embrace]

00:02:06.738 --> 00:02:14.282
The storm is passed, you're safe, you're home.

00:02:14.302 --> 00:02:17.500
The first unconditional...

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:20.204
The first real hug...

00:02:21.885 --> 00:02:25.000
You're safe.

00:02:26.948 --> 00:02:39.960
You're safe...
